      <definition>[= xairatu] adj. Beloved, favorite, darling; loving</definition>
      <page>913</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠶᠢᠷᠠᠲᠠᠢ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
